Statement. $\dot{\mathbf{x}}(t) = \sigma(E,I) \cdot \mathbf{F}(\mathbf{K}_{\mathrm{inf}},\mathbf{\Omega}) \cdot (\mathbf{x}\odot\mathbf{x})$. If $E<E_{\min}$ or $I<I_{\min}$, then $\sigma \to 0$ and $\dot{\mathbf{x}} \to \mathbf{0}$.

